-/**
- * Theme cycle 9: no barrel roll. The full roll showed the fish edge-on (belly or back to the
- * camera), which read as a flat, low-detail fish on the way out. Now it keeps its side, face,
- * fins and outline to the camera and just gives a small happy wiggle (about 12 degrees).
